{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"b300d2a00ef4238c256f8a9d29bc0a1d295803bb4dc8e9a92c0dd26615335564","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":35,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["预言以东受惩罚"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“人子啊，你要面向西珥山，说预言斥责它，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["告诉它，主耶和华这样说，‘西珥山啊，我要与你为敌，伸手攻击你，使你荒凉不堪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我要使你的城邑沦为废墟，一片荒凉，这样你就知道我是耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因为你永怀仇恨，在以色列人遭遇危难、因罪恶受尽刑罚的时候，把他们交在刀剑之下。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所以主耶和华说：我凭我的永恒起誓，我必使你遭受杀人流血之事，杀人流血之事必临到你。你既然不憎恨杀人流血之事，杀人流血之事必临到你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我要使西珥山荒凉不堪，消灭一切来往此地的人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我要使被杀的人遍布你的群山，使丧身刀下的人倒在你的丘陵上、山谷间和各个溪流中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我要使你永远荒废，你的城邑必杳无人迹，这样你就知道我是耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["“‘因为你曾说：犹大和以色列这两个邦国必归我，即使耶和华在那里，我们也要吞并他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["所以主耶和华说：我凭我的永恒起誓，你憎恨他们，满腹怒气和嫉妒，我也必这样对待你。我审判你的时候，以色列人就会认识我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["那时，你必知道我耶和华听见了你毁谤以色列山岭的一切话，你说，这些山岭荒废了，归我们吞并了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你妄自尊大，肆意毁谤我，我都听见了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["主耶和华这样说：普天下欢乐的时候，我要使你荒凉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你既因以色列家的产业荒凉而幸灾乐祸，我要让你遭受同样的下场。西珥山啊，你和整个以东都要荒凉。这样，你们就知道我是耶和华。’”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/35.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/36.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/34.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}